msgstr ""

#: includes/class-givepayments-gateway.php:22
msgid "Accept payments using GivePayments."
msgstr "Acceptez les paiements avec GivePayments."

#: includes/class-givepayments-gateway.php:24
msgid "Pay with Credit and Debit Cards"
msgstr "Payez avec des cartes de crédit et de débit"

#: includes/class-givepayments-gateway.php:26
msgid "Pay securely via GivePayments"
msgstr "Payez en toute sécurité via GivePayments"

#: includes/class-givepayments-gateway.php:49
msgid "General Info"
msgstr "Informations générales"

#: includes/class-givepayments-gateway.php:52
msgid ""
"Enable or disable GivePayments gateway, configure your activation keys,\n"
"                                        and activate test mode to simulate "
"transactions.\n"
"                                        Need help? Check out our detailed "
"documentation for guidance"
msgstr ""
"Activez ou désactivez la passerelle GivePayments, configurez vos clés "
"d’activation\n"
"et activez le mode test pour simuler des transactions.\n"
"Besoin d’aide ? Consultez notre documentation détaillée pour obtenir des "
"conseils"

#: includes/class-givepayments-gateway.php:64
msgid "Enable/Disable"
msgstr "Activer/Désactiver"

#: includes/class-givepayments-gateway.php:66
msgid "Enable GivePayments on Checkout"
msgstr "Activer GivePayments lors du passage en caisse"

#: includes/class-givepayments-gateway.php:70
msgid "Payment Title"
msgstr "Titre du paiement"

#: includes/class-givepayments-gateway.php:72
msgid "Payment method title shown at checkout."
msgstr "Titre du mode de paiement affiché lors du passage en caisse."

#: includes/class-givepayments-gateway.php:77
msgid "Payment Description"
msgstr "Description du paiement"

#: includes/class-givepayments-gateway.php:79
msgid "Payment method description shown at checkout."
msgstr "Description du mode de paiement affichée lors du passage en caisse."

#: includes/class-givepayments-gateway.php:80
msgid "Pay with credit and debit cards"
msgstr "Payez avec des cartes de crédit et de débit"

#: includes/class-givepayments-gateway.php:84
msgid "Order Status"
msgstr "Statut de la commande"

#: includes/class-givepayments-gateway.php:87
msgid "Completed"
msgstr "Terminée"

#: includes/class-givepayments-gateway.php:88
msgid "Processing"
msgstr "En cours de traitement"

#: includes/class-givepayments-gateway.php:90
msgid ""
"Select order status for the WooCommerce order after the transaction is "
"captured on GivePayments"
msgstr ""
"Sélectionnez le statut de la commande WooCommerce après la capture de la "
"transaction sur GivePayments"

#: includes/class-givepayments-gateway.php:92
msgid ""
"The payment title will be visible on the checkout page when the user selects "
"the payment method."
msgstr ""
"Le titre du paiement sera visible sur la page de paiement lorsque "
"l’utilisateur sélectionnera le mode de paiement."

#: includes/class-givepayments-gateway.php:96
msgid "Environment"
msgstr "Environnement"

#: includes/class-givepayments-gateway.php:99
msgid "Sandbox (Testing)"
msgstr "Sandbox (Test)"

#: includes/class-givepayments-gateway.php:100
msgid "Production"
msgstr "Production"

#: includes/class-givepayments-gateway.php:102
msgid "Select environment for the payments"
msgstr "Sélectionnez l’environnement pour les paiements"

#: includes/class-givepayments-gateway.php:104
msgid ""
"Test Mode allows you to test transactions and purchases before switching to "
"Production. Please ensure to use the correct API keys for your selected "
"environment"
msgstr ""
"Le mode test vous permet de tester les transactions et les achats avant de "
"passer en production. Assurez-vous d’utiliser les bonnes clés API pour "
"l’environnement sélectionné"

#: includes/class-givepayments-gateway.php:108
msgid "Production API Key"
msgstr "Clé API de production"

#: includes/class-givepayments-gateway.php:111
msgid "Enter your API key for production use."
msgstr "Saisissez votre clé API pour l’utilisation en production."

#: includes/class-givepayments-gateway.php:116
msgid "Merchant ID"
msgstr "ID du marchand"

#: includes/class-givepayments-gateway.php:119
msgid "Enter your Merchant ID"
msgstr "Enter your Merchant ID"

#: includes/class-givepayments-gateway.php:124
#: includes/class-givepayments-gateway.php:126
msgid "Connection Test"
msgstr "Test de connexion"

#: includes/class-givepayments-gateway.php:130
msgid ""
"Click this button to verify the connection. If successful, your site will be "
"linked to GivePayments after entering the correct keys. The results below "
"indicate the status of your connection, processing, and transfer "
"capabilities."
msgstr ""
"Cliquez sur ce bouton pour vérifier la connexion. Si elle réussit, votre "
"site sera lié à GivePayments après avoir saisi les clés correctes. Les "
"résultats ci-dessous indiquent l’état de votre connexion, ainsi que vos "
"capacités de traitement et de transfert."

#: includes/class-givepayments-gateway.php:137
msgid "GivePayment Merchant Portal"
msgstr "Portail marchand GivePayments"
